      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789573135927,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"Static typed language\" - you get what is in the type definition.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"Static typed language\" - you get what is in the type definition.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XW_LXueXCGvvoVwvjwynl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 225,
      "y": 618,
      "width": 448.79937744140625,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1798133107,
      "version": 150,
      "versionNonce": 1386960787,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789573375343,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "An object is an instance of a definition (class)\nIt has state (data, variables)\nAnd it has behaviors that use or access that state.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "An object is an instance of a definition (class)\nIt has state (data, variables)\nAnd it has behaviors that use or access that state.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kCzZVNkYfbFxnO5s48t2z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 240.60040283203125,
      "y": 718,
      "width": 580.7991943359375,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1902927421,
      "version": 17,
      "versionNonce": 512940275,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789573440839,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Service - some code owned by a team that has private state (date),\nand exposed",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Service - some code owned by a team that has private state (date), and exposed",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xv9dhOqJ-1yr1Pna54dNV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 240.60040283203125,
      "y": 768,
      "width": 580.7991943359375,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1891463187,
      "version": 17,
      "versionNonce": 1263616659,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789573440839,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "behaviors (methods) through some interface for others to access or\nmanipulate that state.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "behaviors (methods) through some interface for others to access or manipulate that state.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iDiO3nSRujVNoWqxbufzi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39,
      "y": 831,
      "width": 598.399169921875,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 349036819,
      "version": 15,
      "versionNonce": 30327613,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789573566654,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "OOP to me means only messaging, local retention and protection and \n\nhiding of state-process, and extreme late-binding of all things. It \n\ncan be done in Smalltalk and in LISP. There are possibly other \n\nsystems in which this is possible, but I'm not aware of them.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OOP to me means only messaging, local retention and protection and \n\nhiding of state-process, and extreme late-binding of all things. It \n\ncan be done in Smalltalk and in LISP. There are possibly other \n\nsystems in which this is possible, but I'm not aware of them.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
