      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Packages\n    - Early bound, pinned to a version. You can't \"force\" an update.\n      - Don't use packages for frequently changing business rules.\n    - tracking is done by Nexus IQ - a security tool that is helluva expensive.\n\n\n\n\nLate Bound",
